{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17943","headline":"江汉答孟郊 · 韩愈","name":"江汉答孟郊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江汉虽云广，乘舟渡无艰。\n流沙信难行，马足常往还。\n凄风结冲波，狐裘能御寒。\n终宵处幽室，华烛光烂烂。\n苟能行忠信，可以居夷蛮。\n嗟余与夫子，此义每所敦。\n何爲复见赠，缱绻在不谖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17943.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17943","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}